    {
      "id": "quote:a779db42f6ed23fd",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 409,
        "char_start": 291,
        "episode_id": "e741f35a-8dd9-5c40-9d5c-905f4dca4122",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Today's episode is sponsored by Notion. Notion replaces the dozen tools your team is half-using. Try notion.com today.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:61357c59e73acaba",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 485,
        "char_start": 409,
        "episode_id": "e741f35a-8dd9-5c40-9d5c-905f4dca4122",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "I want to dig into that. What's the most underrated piece of cultural drift?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:3663842cf3e30f6a",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 712,
        "char_start": 499,
        "episode_id": "e741f35a-8dd9-5c40-9d5c-905f4dca4122",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Yeah, so \u2014 There's something about the way conversations actually unfold that essays can't capture. We've seen this play out at teams using Patreon. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
