        "char_start": 718,
        "episode_id": "e741f35a-8dd9-5c40-9d5c-905f4dca4122",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "I want to dig into that. Where do dialogue and cultural drift intersect?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:a6c7fd758a897ac1",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 919,
        "char_start": 804,
        "episode_id": "e741f35a-8dd9-5c40-9d5c-905f4dca4122",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Sure. The texture of dialogue is the work. The framing matters because it tells you which trade-offs you're making.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p06_e01.txt"
